{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "d60423f9d196ac7438a6e3f294973b33b0f46c3fa1324a6fb3b62e2b9d10d6a4", "ja": "がんばる理由は", "zh": "努力的理由是", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5dfc89704f2006a7e0566d08c3a423b75e44ea9ce3d8a5bebb08abd06261e37", "ja": "遅くまで自主練を続けるアイドル達。「そん\nなに不安か？」と尋ねるプロデューサーに、\nみんなは「楽しいからやっているだけ！」と\n返答。無理はダメだと諭しながら、自分も同\nじだとしみじみ思うプロデューサー。", "zh": "偶像们练习到了深夜。制作人问她们“有那么不安吗？”，大家回答：“只是因为开心才练的！”制作人一边劝她们不能勉强自己，一边深有感触地觉得自己也一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c313438e66b37dbdfce71701b0d68c90ef489793f5f8d75b6445cdba71fd5a28", "ja": "（……おっと、もうこんな時間か。\nそろそろ切り上げるかな……ん？）", "zh": "（……哎呀，已经这么晚了啊。差不多该收工了吧……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1001_p", "source_sha256": "261a8f3e8fdc7025f977e6afd0f726c5371d2ba24a7a25a10980b042de1f747c", "ja": "（そういえば、歩たちはどうなったかな？\nまさかとは思うけど……）", "zh": "说起来，步她们后来怎么样了？不会吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9b21a39fa38030ca5f032ce40ab447c04ba128cc73e344dda4d7ca82ef06e41d", "ja": "ワン・ツー・スリー・フォー……キメッ！\nん～……ダメだ、どうしてもここが合わないな～。", "zh": "一、二、三、四……定格！\n嗯……不行，这里怎么都合不上拍～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "25ce2677e2f34bd0c1cc76d568626d68d461064fc3170e548607c1e65a62dbf6", "ja": "うぅ、なんだかタイミングが取れないんですよね……。\nなんでかな～？", "zh": "呜呜，总觉得找不准时机……\n这是为什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "44d9a5ce85703431caecd9d93d1431d70a78ca8bc1a8e04dc9ad3c859814d05e", "ja": "ひとつ前の動きからの流れが、けっこう難しいかも？\nそっちでズレちゃうんだと思うな。", "zh": "从前一个动作衔接过来，可能有点难吧？\n我觉得应该就是在那边错开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "15f9752641aa32d750b4a8a42cbb2a3f992448d88230b0176890858d23718218", "ja": "むむ……では、ありさの撮った動画で、\n動きの見直しをするというのはどうでしょうか？", "zh": "唔唔……那么，用亚利沙拍的视频\n来重新检查一下动作，大家觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7ba34a3ac8e98b7f6b0ecf45402504380169d83a170fa5a246a38009a4c8cec0", "ja": "おっ、いいね！　あ、でも……マイガーッ！？\nもうこんな時間！　そろそろ帰らないと……。", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！啊，不过……糟糕！？已经这么晚了！差不多该回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "4ba971ee276ea434246e84d9e8c9fd7c852bb22be5b7aea3116439a0188e8e7c", "ja": "えーっ！？　せっかくコツが掴めそうなのに～……。\nもうちょっとだけ！　……ダメかな～？", "zh": "诶——！？好不容易就快摸到诀窍了～……\n再多待一会儿！……不行吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "6962aedad29eed24dcc656a3788dee564db3b442206af8d53dcb1564e80a152a", "ja": "気持ちはわかりますケド、\n{$P$}さんに心配されちゃいますし。", "zh": "我能理解你的心情啦，不过要是被{$P$}先生担心了就不好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "445d39cc5779bfdcca6c7b329b07fe0fbd059583acecc5bca34e7f4f95912752", "ja": "うーん……だったら～、その辺に隠れておいて、\n帰ったふりして、続きをする、とか？", "zh": "嗯……既然这样～，那就先藏在附近，装作已经回去了，再继续之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "5c116bdbc191e56917d877c8fabf03ad3a03bd281a526f34bc1de4b121dd39a7", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんなの、悪い子じゃないですか～！\nちょっとだけ楽しそうですけど……。", "zh": "诶！？那样不就成坏孩子了吗～！\n不过感觉好像有点有趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_1012", "source_sha256": "77dae58ea87632af946d37b0ff3d34d13228197c3b2bcf733883edcb43181d40", "ja": "コラーッ！", "zh": "喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c879bc889c04f64a6e9603a0217a776b66190122bf181f931065886327d7a171", "ja": "こらっ！　美希、聞こえたぞ！", "zh": "喂！美希，我听到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "c6a00ca3f1dbe54a63fd7c0fac18742ee8dc6d0a2bf232baccec2f5166cbf28e", "ja": "はうっ！？　{$P$}さん！", "zh": "呜哇！？{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "4ae9ab9348987cbafc26694e500e6861dccd2faa7d94558684b07e14082bfc69", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　来るのが早いの～。\nミキが「もーいーよ！」って言ってからね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！你来得也太早啦～  \n要等美希说“已经可以啦！”才行哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ffa09427e1892be35837befb90772822d8960234f472bde1605605dd5ec4620a", "ja": "いや……かくれんぼはしないぞ。\nほらほら、みんな急いで、帰り支度をするんだ。", "zh": "不……我可没在跟你们捉迷藏。\n好啦好啦，大家快点收拾，准备回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "12fe994a3155596cd64c73d141c9d6d04d8eb2d9bbdb0cb408b81089def95b61", "ja": "{$P$}、ゴメン！\nアタシがちゃんと見るって言ったのに……うぅ。", "zh": "{$P$}，对不起！\n明明说过我会好好看着的……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2005_p", "source_sha256": "1d382a12905cd98382ab017a9159f701a80e7dbba271f0f5e91dba3066dbd6f0", "ja": "いや、歩が謝るようなことはないよ。\n熱心にレッスンしてくれるのは、ありがたいし。", "zh": "不，步不需要向我道歉。\n你那么热心地指导大家练习，我也很感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2006_p", "source_sha256": "c6bc52c8d6705d59197a54b8d321983111e985531a2c66210a414dc2d8311f23", "ja": "けど……みんな、そんなに焦ってるのか？\n不安にさせちゃってるとしたら、申し訳ないな……。", "zh": "不过……大家有那么着急吗？\n要是让你们感到不安了，我很抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2007_028ari", "source_sha256": "abb80577facb2cfd2070d21075a787b63761a22c10442532228a237d0217641c", "ja": "え？　あ……違うんです{$P$}さん！\nありさたち、別に焦ってるんじゃなくてですね……。", "zh": "诶？啊……不是那样的，{$P$}先生！\n我们才不是着急，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d43552705ac22ace3bedb17ad59d951a7ac4485fca908dbe3c6356ee229bea77", "ja": "うんうん、全然焦ってなんかないです。\n私たち、ただ楽しいからレッスンしてたんですよ～。", "zh": "嗯嗯，完全没有着急啦。\n我们只是因为觉得开心，才在这里练习的呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2009_p", "source_sha256": "a5dde2699bd90514df67d96a1eccb668d143bead18e5dcea35af9bc3e9b4743a", "ja": "楽しいから、レッスンを？　……そうか。", "zh": "因为开心，所以练习？……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2010_p", "source_sha256": "20fef4dfd8782e5ff63a3def40d5bfb428b8cac72cb32d2ba9d6d82e6af96787", "ja": "それは最高だと思うけど、やっぱり無理はダメだ。\n今日はここまでにして、また明日な。", "zh": "我觉得那当然是最棒的，不过还是不能勉强自己。\n今天就到这里，明天再继续。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f9c306f00d062d0087e2cbd3ae3e9df373675b5272ffc8801f8e4421641f2b5f", "ja": "うん、そうだね！　亜利沙、よかったらみんなに\n動画を送ってくれない？　見直しならそれでできるし。", "zh": "嗯，说得对！亚利沙，方便的话\n能把视频发给大家吗？要复习的话看那个就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2012_028ari", "source_sha256": "de1fbfccf51dd1ed6cb193a2bf53e2ed2d6ea668d0da57efd37c7a8d62e30bf5", "ja": "もちろんオッケーです！\nありさの秘蔵動画、バッチリ共有しますね、ムフフ♪", "zh": "当然没问题！\n亚利沙的珍藏视频，一定会好好分享给大家的，呼呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2013_003mik", "source_sha256": "1df898ca4e8dc2acf5c3a68e89bcfd5a91f9fca003c6513265e7f9e1e87c2d1f", "ja": "ねぇねぇ{$P$}、もう遅いし、\n送ってくれるよね？　あと、みんなでごはんもね！", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}，已经很晚了，你会发给我的，对吧？大家一起吃饭也要哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2014_p", "source_sha256": "823d96a3b5056bd2d50f366c2dfc74c3fc8fef4d2c18adddde4db1f533ac4c0b", "ja": "（レッスンが楽しい、か……そうだな。\n大変なことはあるけど、プロデュースも同じだ）", "zh": "（上课很开心吗……这样啊。虽然也有辛苦的时候，但制作偶像也是一样的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_08_2015_p", "source_sha256": "884ae562e0f7797a5a18b7cb4969b29905784d45d60f68a6c651a629f8995a31", "ja": "（大切なことを、思い出させてもらった気がする。\n仕方ない……みんなでごはん、食べていくか！）", "zh": "（感觉她让我想起了一件重要的事。没办法……还是大家一起吃个饭再走吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
